        "comment": "1: the hook: the question and the claim, then 'Se on tämä.' into the bike",
        "duration": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "type": 0
    },
    {
        "comment": "2: what it is: vajerin kireyden säädin (the adjuster in view)",
        "duration": 0,
        "pos": 222,
        "type": 0
    },
    {
        "comment": "3: where it is, the 0.6 s pause before 'täällä' out; the click at 20.3 left out",
        "duration": 0,
        "pos": 299,
        "type": 0
    },
    {
        "comment": "4: the why: tune the gears while riding (hand on the adjuster)",
        "duration": 0,
        "pos": 345,
        "type": 0
    },
